;; LOCAL Sweep-1 N=3 CONFIRM (Test phase 3). Same 2×2 × 8 Q as the c1 re-screen but
;; N=3 to beat down the N=1 variance, after the finalize empty-recovery + context-
;; grounding fixes (graphs.clj). concurrency 1 (big agent prefills don't batch).
;; judge? false → cloud gpt-5.5 via `bb sweep-judge` after.
;;
;; Front-runner from the two N=1 concurrency-1 runs: adapted-prompt + default-budget
;; (stable effQ 0.51/0.51, best retrieval recall@10 0.69 / golden-read 0.75 / ans-hit
;; 1.00). Budget axis was noise. This batch confirms it. ~96 serial runs (~4-4.5h).
;;
;; Run with the agent-run OPENAI_* env (preserve_thinking + recommended thinking sampling).
{:configs
 [{:id "default-prompt+default-budget"
   :skill-graph-id :builtin/agent-rag-graph-bundled
   :agent-prompt-variant :default
   :skill-params {}}
  {:id "adapted-prompt+default-budget"
   :skill-graph-id :builtin/agent-rag-graph-bundled
   :agent-prompt-variant :qwen-adapted
   :skill-params {}}
